          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "No worries 👍 — this looks like **keyboard / input corruption** rather than a real word.\n\nLet’s fix this step-by-step.\n\n### First: check your keyboard (very common issue)\nOn **Windows 10**:\n1. Press **Win + Space**\n2. Make sure it says **ENG (US)** or **ENG (Canada)**\n3. If you see something like **INTL / DVORAK / another language**, switch back to **ENG**\n\nAlso try:\n- Turn **Caps Lock OFF**\n- Close the browser tab → reopen it\n- Try typing **slowly**: `test`\n\n### Second: tell me what you were trying to say\nYou can answer with **any one of these**:\n- “It’s about **software**”\n- “It’s about **coding**”\n- “It’s about **email / letter**”\n- “It’s about **Excel / Google Sheets**”\n- Or just type **one clear sentence**, even short\n\nIf typing is hard right now, you can also:\n- Copy–paste\n- Or say: **“keyboard problem”** and I’ll guide you through fixing it fully\n\nTake your time — I’ve got you."
          ]
