        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Ah — got it 👍  \nYou most likely mean **AUTODESK**.\n\n### What is Autodesk?\n**Autodesk** is a company that makes professional **design, engineering, and construction software**.\n\n### Most common Autodesk software\n- **AutoCAD** – 2D & 3D drafting (architecture, electrical, mechanical)\n- **Revit** – Building design (BIM) for architects & engineers\n- **Fusion 360** – 3D design, PCB, CAD/CAM (very popular)\n- **3ds Max / Maya** – 3D animation & modeling\n- **Inventor** – Mechanical engineering design\n- **Civil 3D** – Roads, land, and infrastructure design\n\n### Common things people ask about Autodesk\n- Free or **student versions**\n- **AutoCAD installation**\n- Converting **PDF ↔ DWG**\n- Learning AutoCAD / Fusion 360 step-by-step\n- System requirements\n- Cracked vs legal versions (⚠️ I only help with legal options)\n\n### Tell me what you want to do\nReply with **one line**, for example:\n- “Learn AutoCAD from zero”\n- “Free Autodesk software”\n- “Install AutoCAD on Windows 10”\n- “Fusion 360 PCB / 3D design”\n- “PDF to AutoCAD DWG”\n\nI’ll guide you **step-by-step**, no pressure."
          ]
